{"id":"2d3d09243502cff8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/065_线性归结_Linear_Resolution.md","title":"065 线性归结 Linear Resolution","display":"065_线性归结_Linear_Resolution","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-子句签名\">1. 子句签名</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,fun,rel,pos,neg\">\\(var,fun,rel,pos,neg\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Lin}=(State_{Lin},Init_{Lin},Rule_{Lin})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{Lin}=(State_{Lin},Init_{Lin},Rule_{Lin})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中每一步只有一个当前中心子句，另一前提只能来自输入子句集或祖先序列；本系统不允许任意两个旁子句互相归结。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、原子、文字与子句\">2. 项、原子、文字与子句</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_\\Sigma\">\\(At_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\">\\(rel(R,\\tau)\\)</span> 组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Rel\">\\(R\\in Rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R(R)=n\">\\(ar_R(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。文字集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pos(P)\">\\(pos(P)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(P)\">\\(neg(P)\\)</span> 组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>。子句严格取为有限多重集函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>成员、空子句、单文字多重集、重数和、截断删除、长度及补文字分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n(C\\ominus[L])(K)=\n\\begin{cases}C(L)-1,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)&gt;0,\\\\C(K),&amp;K\\ne L,\\\\0,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)=0,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n(C\\ominus[L])(K)=\n\\begin{cases}C(L)-1,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)&gt;0,\\\\C(K),&amp;K\\ne L,\\\\0,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)=0,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{pos(P)}=neg(P),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{neg(P)}=pos(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{pos(P)}=neg(P),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{neg(P)}=pos(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C+D\">\\(C+D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C-\\{L\\}\">\\(C-\\{L\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{L\\}\">\\(\\{L\\}\\)</span> 分别作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\oplus D\">\\(C\\oplus D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\ominus[L]\">\\(C\\ominus[L]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[L]\">\\([L]\\)</span> 的缩写。上述运算均保持有限支撑，因而值仍属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与合一\">3. 自由变量、替换与合一</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>系统无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 作用于项、原子、文字和子句：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"pos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\\qquad neg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[pos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\\qquad neg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\unicode{x0141}\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\unicode{x0141}\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此子句替换是多重集像：发生文字合并时重数相加，而不是退化为集合像。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\">\\(MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\theta=Q\\theta\">\\(P\\theta=Q\\theta\\)</span>，并且对任一替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\eta=Q\\eta\">\\(P\\eta=Q\\eta\\)</span>，则存在替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho\">\\(\\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-变量分离与二元归结核\">4. 变量分离与二元归结核</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量分离谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart(C,D,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(D&#39;=D\\bar\\rho\\land FV_C(C)\\cap FV_C(D&#39;)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart(C,D,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(D&#39;=D\\bar\\rho\\land FV_C(C)\\cap FV_C(D&#39;)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义二元归结核函数谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BinRes(C,D,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BinRes(C,D,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;\">\\(D&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(L,M\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>、原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span>、替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart(C,D,D&#39;),\\quad C(L)&gt;0,\\quad D&#39;(M)&gt;0,\n\\quad L=pos(P),\\quad M=neg(Q),\\quad MGU(P,Q,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart(C,D,D&#39;),\\quad C(L)&gt;0,\\quad D&#39;(M)&gt;0,\n\\quad L=pos(P),\\quad M=neg(Q),\\quad MGU(P,Q,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E=((C-\\{L\\})+(D&#39;-\\{M\\}))\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E=((C-\\{L\\})+(D&#39;-\\{M\\}))\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-线性状态\">5. 线性状态</h1>\n<p>线性状态集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"State_{Lin}(S)\">\\(State_{Lin}(S)\\)</span> 由四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C_0,C,A,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C_0,C,A,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\\in S\">\\(C_0\\in S\\)</span> 是顶子句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(C\\in Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是当前中心子句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是祖先序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。初态谓词为</p>\n<p>定义状态投影</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=C_0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Center}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=C,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Top}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=C_0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Center}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=C,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=A,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{AncLen}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Anc}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=A,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{AncLen}_{Lin}(C_0,C,A,k)=k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义祖先压栈函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}:\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(Cl_\\Sigma^k\\times Cl_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}Cl_\\Sigma^{k+1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}:\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(Cl_\\Sigma^k\\times Cl_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}Cl_\\Sigma^{k+1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C)|_k=A,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C)(k)=C\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C)|_k=A,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C)(k)=C\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>初态谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{Lin}^S(C_0,C,A,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_0\\in S\\land C=C_0\\land k=0\\land A:\\varnothing\\to Cl_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{Lin}^S(C_0,C,A,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_0\\in S\\land C=C_0\\land k=0\\land A:\\varnothing\\to Cl_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>输入子句初始集合形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"InitCl_{Lin}(S)=S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[InitCl_{Lin}(S)=S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义旁子句选择证书</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin}^{S}(A,k,D,w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin}^{S}(A,k,D,w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(A:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>，且恰有下列一种情形：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=(\\mathsf{input},D)\n\\land D\\in S,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=(\\mathsf{input},D)\n\\land D\\in S,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=(\\mathsf{ancestor},i,D)\n\\land i&lt;k\n\\land D=A(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=(\\mathsf{ancestor},i,D)\n\\land i&lt;k\n\\land D=A(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时第二种情形无证书，故初态只能选择输入子句。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-线性步规则\">6. 线性步规则</h1>\n<p>线性步关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Lin}^S\\subseteq State_{Lin}(S)\\times State_{Lin}(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Lin}^S\\subseteq State_{Lin}(S)\\times State_{Lin}(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((C_0,C,A,k),(C_0,E,A&#39;,k+1))\\in Rule_{Lin}^S\">\\(((C_0,C,A,k),(C_0,E,A&#39;,k+1))\\in Rule_{Lin}^S\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(D\\in Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与证书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin}^{S}(A,k,D,w),\n\\qquad\nBinRes(C,D,E),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin}^{S}(A,k,D,w),\n\\qquad\nBinRes(C,D,E),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&#39;=\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&#39;=\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin}(A,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-线性归结推导\">7. 线性归结推导</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 出发的线性归结推导是非空有限状态序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(s_0,\\ldots,s_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi=(s_0,\\ldots,s_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span> 是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\\in S\">\\(C_0\\in S\\)</span> 的初态。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1&lt;m\">\\(i+1&lt;m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s_i,s_{i+1})\\in Rule_{Lin}^S\">\\((s_i,s_{i+1})\\in Rule_{Lin}^S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对固定S⊆Cl，lastC_S是偏函数，域为所有非空有限State_Lin(S)列，余域Cl；主判断只在Der_LinRes(S,Π)上调用。末状态中心子句函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"lastC_S(\\Pi)=C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists C_0\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists k\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{Lin}(S)\\wedge\n\\Pi(m-1)=(C_0,C,A,k)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[lastC_S(\\Pi)=C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists C_0\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists k\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{Lin}(S)\\wedge\n\\Pi(m-1)=(C_0,C,A,k)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes}(S,\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes}(S,\\Pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{Lin}(S)\n\\wedge\n\\exists C_0,C,A,k\\bigl(Init_{Lin}^S(C_0,C,A,k)\\wedge \\Pi(0)=(C_0,C,A,k)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ (\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{Lin}^{S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{Lin}(S)\n\\wedge\n\\exists C_0,C,A,k\\bigl(Init_{Lin}^S(C_0,C,A,k)\\wedge \\Pi(0)=(C_0,C,A,k)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ (\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{Lin}^{S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可推出子句与线性反驳\">8. 可推出子句与线性反驳</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash_{LinRes}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge lastC_S(\\Pi)=C\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\vdash_{LinRes}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge lastC_S(\\Pi)=C\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记lastC为该按S索引函数族；若同一Π同时在两个合法列域内，输出均为实际末状态Center，因而一致。State_Lin、Init_Lin、Rule_Lin亦是上述按S参数的族。MGU域At²×Sub，定义中η、ρ均量化Sub_Σ。可推出闭包和线性反驳谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{LinRes}(S)=\\{C\\in Cl_\\Sigma:S\\vdash_{LinRes}C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{LinRes}(S)=\\{C\\in Cl_\\Sigma:S\\vdash_{LinRes}C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ref_{LinRes}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash_{LinRes}\\Box.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ref_{LinRes}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash_{LinRes}\\Box.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{LinRes}\n=\n(State_{Lin},Init_{Lin},Rule_{Lin},\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes},\n\\vdash_{LinRes},Ref_{LinRes}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{LinRes}\n=\n(State_{Lin},Init_{Lin},Rule_{Lin},\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes},\n\\vdash_{LinRes},Ref_{LinRes}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LinearResolution}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n\\ominus,\n|-|,\n\\overline{(-)},\nFV_C,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU,\nApart,\nBinRes,\nState_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Center}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Anc}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{AncLen}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin},\nInit_{Lin},\nInitCl_{Lin},\nRule_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes},\nlastC,\n\\vdash_{LinRes},\nRef_{LinRes},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{LinRes},\n\\Delta_{LinRes}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LinearResolution}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n\\ominus,\n|-|,\n\\overline{(-)},\nFV_C,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU,\nApart,\nBinRes,\nState_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Center}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Anc}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{AncLen}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Push}_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Side}_{Lin},\nInit_{Lin},\nInitCl_{Lin},\nRule_{Lin},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{LinRes},\nlastC,\n\\vdash_{LinRes},\nRef_{LinRes},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{LinRes},\n\\Delta_{LinRes}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含以当前中心子句为唯一活动前提的线性归结步；不含任意两旁子句归结、有序极大限制或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-子句签名","text":"1. 子句签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、原子、文字与子句","text":"2. 项、原子、文字与子句","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与合一","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与合一","level":1},{"id":"4.-变量分离与二元归结核","text":"4. 变量分离与二元归结核","level":1},{"id":"5.-线性状态","text":"5. 线性状态","level":1},{"id":"6.-线性步规则","text":"6. 线性步规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-线性归结推导","text":"7. 线性归结推导","level":1},{"id":"8.-可推出子句与线性反驳","text":"8. 可推出子句与线性反驳","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"var,fun,rel,pos,neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{Lin}=(State_{Lin},Init_{Lin},Rule_{Lin})","display":true},{"tex":"Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"rel(R,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in Rel","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Lit_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"pos(P)","display":false},{"tex":"neg(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)>0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)>0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&K=L,\\\\0,&K\\ne L,\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n(C\\ominus[L])(K)=\n\\begin{cases}C(L)-1,&K=L\\land C(L)>0,\\\\C(K),&K\\ne L,\\\\0,&K=L\\land C(L)=0,\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{pos(P)}=neg(P),\n\\qquad\n\\overline{neg(P)}=pos(P).","display":true},{"tex":"C+D","display":false},{"tex":"C-\\{L\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{L\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\oplus D","display":false},{"tex":"C\\ominus[L]","display":false},{"tex":"[L]","display":false},{"tex":"Cl_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i<ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i<ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigm